{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15302075","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15302075","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530207501:0":{"text":"네. 저희는 밀을 기르지 못하니까, 보칼리스인들이 가르쳐줘야 하거든요.","source_cn":"是的，我们不会种小麦，还需要呼临人来教我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D5368FAEF1670C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530207502:0":{"text":"그래서 저희가 밀 기르는 법을 깨달을 때까지 군영에 있을 거래요.","source_cn":"这些人会留在军营，直到教会我们种小麦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC866511B24C217B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530207503:0":{"text":"근데 왜 군영이랑 벽을 그대로 두는 걸까? 왔다 갔다 하기 불편한데!","source_cn":"可为什么还要留着军营和围墙，出入多不方便啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44EEBDE0B3419CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530207504:1":{"text":"아니면 역시 우리를 경계하고 있는 건가?","source_cn":"还是说，他们在防着我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA3BBDB845A5FBB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柔耳":{"text":"소프트이어","source":"柔耳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:印":{"text":"스탬프","source":"印","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}